  "term": "syntax",
  "definition": "In this packet, syntax refers to space syntax: a way of describing and measuring how spaces are arranged to study how spatial layout relates to people’s movement, preferences, and behavior. It focuses on configuration features such as how connected or integrated places are within a larger environment.",
